---
<Base title="Yaro Korets (Yaroslav Korets) — Forward Deployed Engineer CV" description="CV of Yaro (Yaroslav) Korets, Forward Deployed Engineer and founder of Growth Control. Hands-on AI deployment for tax and accounting firms." path="/cv/" current="CV" type="profile" graph={graph}>
